{"id": "tech-4", "headline": "Google redesigns search homepage around AI, drops search button", "source": "Ars Technica", "url": "https://arstechnica.com/ai/2026/11/googles-latest-search-page-redesign-drops-the-search-button-adds-ai-sidebar/", "published": "2026-11-20", "url_verified": true, "pages": ["Google is rolling out a redesigned desktop search homepage that drops the Google Search button and adds easier access to AI features, Ars Technica reports. The design was tested for several weeks. Search VP Robby Stein confirmed the rollout on X. New buttons under the search bar cover image generation, analyzing files and brainstorming with Gemini. The \"I'm Feeling Lucky\" button remains. Ars notes the old button was hard to reach, since autocomplete suggestions cover it while typing, and pressing Enter does the same job. The change shows how quickly Google is turning search into an AI product. Source: Ars Technica"], "qr": {"n": 41, "rows": ["11111110101100001001110100100011101111111", "10000010011000100100001110100000001000001", "10111010110111101010001111111010001011101", "10111010111000010010001111110100001011101", "10111010100100001110000010111101001011101", "10000010000111011010010011000001001000001", "11111110101010101010101010101010101111111", "00000000011000011101001100101111100000000", "11110010101000110100110100010101010011101", "00011000111011001111110100100111101111011", "10101011010101001010001110001100010110100", "00000100101000000101100111010001001000000", "11101111000100101000101111100111100101101", "10001101011100100000110010110001001001011", "10111111100010100011100010001111101100011", "10101001100010110000010110001010001101010", "10111111110111000010111101110010110010010", "00011001000111011010101111111100110101000", "11111010100000010010000000111000011110000", "01001000001110000110000010100111000101111", "10010011101001011001010010111110011010111", "10100001100000111000110100101011111011001", "11011011010000010001101111001000010010110", "00001000